	["The seller will show the price first. Confirm the sale once more to finish this tutorial."] = "H\225\187\141 s\225\186\189 b\195\161o gi\195\161 tr\198\176\225\187\155c. B\225\186\161n x\195\161c nh\225\186\173n b\195\161n th\195\170m l\225\186\167n n\225\187\175a l\195\160 xong ph\225\186\167n h\198\176\225\187\155ng d\225\186\171n.",
	["Well done! You rolled a skill, equipped it, caught a fish, and sold your catch."] = "Xong r\225\187\147i! B\225\186\161n \196\145\195\163 quay k\225\187\185 n\196\131ng, l\225\186\175p v\195\160o c\225\186\167n, c\195\162u \196\145\198\176\225\187\163c c\195\161 r\225\187\147i \196\145em b\195\161n.",
